{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "89b3b8946d99714185e201650a860e51737720fcb6c96d00b2e47ae5692d794b", "ja": "公演後、ユニットは大反響！　打ち上げはフ\nァミレスで行う事に。丁度開催していたコラ\nボ特典のシールに夢中になる一同。胃と財布\nに大打撃を受けながらも、プロデューサーは\n3人のこれからに期待するのだった。", "zh": "公演结束后，组合获得了热烈反响！大家决定在家庭餐厅举办庆功宴。众人都沉迷于当时正好举办的联动活动特典贴纸。尽管胃和钱包都受到了重创，制作人依然期待着3人的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2005da4380cdf4323b7a841f8b4771aa24bf643de7ff11344daf05093d5b92b8", "ja": "（3人をモデルとCMに起用した、新規の\nプチプラコスメブランドがいよいよ発表された）", "zh": "（起用3人为模特和广告代言人的全新平价化妆品品牌终于发布了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d8499322a67d08a3d92ad34b15b74a5b66a7637841e4fcaf263f27179319652e", "ja": "（反響は凄まじく、主要なティーン向け\nファッション誌から、モデル依頼が殺到している）", "zh": "（反响极其热烈，各大面向青少年的时尚杂志纷纷发来模特邀约。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "91fa402a11ab17d327ebf00be04ce2be2c98f8626e1a09e8e32c6d63b9e0c9f6", "ja": "（しばらく忙しい日々が続く事になるだろう……\nこの打ち上げで、英気を養ってもらわないとな！）", "zh": "（接下来一段时间大概都会很忙……得让她们在这次庆功宴上好好恢复精神才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "3af03968b657951b49fb720794a15940fa526db7f0ee49a3d3039c59fa487a67", "ja": "公演は終わったけど、今度は雑誌のお仕事に、\n来年の新色に向けて撮影だって……。", "zh": "演出结束了，可接下来还有杂志的工作，还要为明年的新色进行拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "cee835608f57bd3e1a16b6ee806bbc30e46d039a82788c0de5ece49c09e88f87", "ja": "たまき、いっぱい写真撮ったのに……。\nあんなにたくさん撮って、あまらないのかなぁ？", "zh": "环，明明拍了好多照片……  \n拍了那么多，不会剩下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "eeded3a09c6b5034e24f960d16c8c86d8774f5aa809c63ec54220ccd68c6627c", "ja": "お菓子じゃないんだから、あまらないの。\nそれに、お仕事があるのはいいことでしょ。", "zh": "又不是零食，怎么会剩下来。再说，有工作不是好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9adf6ad78b85a7a95444c20089121aeb940149329b0165040563540a8cc84143", "ja": "ああ、仕事があるのはなによりだ。ところで、\nみんなの希望でファミレスにしたけど、よかったのか？", "zh": "啊，有工作总是最好的。对了，虽然是按照大家的希望选了家庭餐厅，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "2852112779b7fe9634f851cff86071b718b71fb52371c22463853dc7f3534232", "ja": "うん！　3人で相談して、決めたんだ。\nメニューがたくさんあって楽しいでしょ♪", "zh": "嗯！我们3个人商量后决定的。菜单种类很多，很开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "2e592ab48167dd8cb4b2f1772224e0ad78ef58fcc26b28e12030e1ab18ba4fb1", "ja": "それと……お兄ちゃんのお財布事情を\n考えたら、やっぱりファミレスかなって。", "zh": "还有……考虑到哥哥的钱包情况，果然还是家庭餐厅比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "45bbe80664d02300eec058ce0acfa95c09a20b57027e7a9df9044fedacfe5129", "ja": "うん。わたしたち、ちゃんと気はつかえるから。\nおねだりばっかりしてちゃ、よくないもんね。", "zh": "嗯。我们还是会体谅别人的。\n总是缠着别人要东西，也不太好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c81d2024aea9db89e32ee9869385d2b85745c95a8196eca9be071bd6c7abceb9", "ja": "はは……3人に気を遣われるとはな。\nならせめて、好きなものを食べてくれ！", "zh": "哈哈……没想到会被3个人照顾到。既然这样，至少吃点你喜欢的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "aa56bce2be44d196d386b84572828abf950e7e2e54570f713057a1e2e498e83f", "ja": "たまき、お子様ランチがいい！\nおまけがついてるから！", "zh": "环，我想要儿童套餐！\n因为还有附赠品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "a68e0790b5ec862818cf513b59a5bfa7897c3ccfa24aa4ee34dbcca9430ab663", "ja": "あっ……でも今、『ぺたぺたヤギ』の\nコラボメニューやってるぞ！", "zh": "啊……不过现在有“啪嗒啪嗒山羊”的联动菜单哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "935a4dd6c7463b5269ea6b2bb61e7c9172a4d2bf7fb6a5380bc97295bbcaa2b5", "ja": "わあ、ホントだ！　今なら\nおまけでシールがもらえるんだって！", "zh": "哇，真的耶！听说现在还有附赠的贴纸可以拿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "8823b334fc40880d466ed978e4508e1f131cc7fb9eecba5693f57a96ac897248", "ja": "桃子も、集めてるけど……\nコラボ限定のシールなら、欲しいかも。", "zh": "桃子也在收集，不过……\n如果是联动限定贴纸，我或许会想要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b02bdf126849bed588f23deea4a9aa3a7888ac4665320e58b18ebfe5fe1c1a31", "ja": "あの、盛り上がってるところ悪いんだけど……\n『ぺたぺたヤギ』ってなんだ？", "zh": "那个，正聊得起劲呢，打断一下不好意思……\n“贴贴山羊”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "fc325c9debc7346eb488f03b65fab1b33dff715e4f2f811b3aed0299be01595f", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、知らないの？\nいま小学生の間で、すごく流行ってるのに。", "zh": "哥哥，你不知道吗？\n这可是现在小学生之间超流行的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "5cc66bc000d686460628f1d3a6cff88a373be321a6770ca8788380870c1fb997", "ja": "シールになったヤギが、色んなところに\nくっつきながら、がんばって生きてくんだよ！", "zh": "变成贴纸的山羊，会一边到处粘来粘去，一边努力地活下去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "1f1c81f004eff380bbe98b6b246e3c9fc7fff791e0753f4f0f57a0240888f90d", "ja": "それじゃあ、たまきは\n『ぺたぺたヤギ』のカレーにする！", "zh": "那环玉就要吃“贴贴小山羊”咖喱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "20423bb86d49ba3066967fae4a950618f03aa10105eea403d984b2f47e8db8c8", "ja": "わたしも、コラボメニューにする！\nハンバーグがいい！", "zh": "我也要点联名餐点！\n我要汉堡肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "a854185721ff04579ac602a6fab06acb04a7fc5af84b437fd385e8464aa7af45", "ja": "ふーん……確かにこれ、かわいいかも。\nじゃあ桃子も、コラボのサンドイッチにしようかな。", "zh": "嗯……确实，这个可能挺可爱的。\n那桃子也做联动三明治好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "ddd6f98d5505c67f1b5e3b52a3d48fb0b954bf541a0b955713ff0cadc4d48a25", "ja": "やったー！　たまき、\nレアの黒ヤギがでたぞ！", "zh": "太好啦～！环抽到\n稀有的黑山羊了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "a3e499c0638a7f353e2af8ec5db85c163dc5beeb4ab19a3901de621028bf3a22", "ja": "えーっ！　いいないいな！\n環ちゃん、みせて！", "zh": "诶——！真好真好！\n环，给我看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb9c4f83e0dbaea1128349793bd0b3625aece676b97248b6c6bf7a4f7ef3efcc", "ja": "う、ツノがかわいい……。ねえ、環。\n桃子が持ってるシールと、交換しない？", "zh": "呜，羊角好可爱……。呐，环。\n要不要用桃子手里的贴纸交换？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee90cb6633eae17316ab973f17d3a180c8983e2a48290f491073947d05a6bfe4", "ja": "えっ、桃子ちゃん交換してくれるの！？\nそれならわたしの子ヤギと、その双子ヤギを……。", "zh": "诶，桃子愿意和我交换吗！？\n那就用我的小山羊，换那只双胞胎小山羊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "f21fdab427efa9ec3ed82990f9e9d0ea1dd8c27840c5a0e2c96053cfa9ce0cd9", "ja": "あっ、たまき、子ヤギが一番ほしかったぞ……。\nうう……ど、どうしよう……。", "zh": "啊，环……最想要的就是小山羊啊……\n呜呜……怎、怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2cd7e2a33a6ee245a7a5e73643a3cbc5b4e4c731ae68eb121e287dac88fb1c1b", "ja": "まあまあ。3人とも落ち着いて。シールを\n集めたいなら、追加を頼めばいいじゃないか。", "zh": "好了好了，3个人都冷静一下。想收集贴纸的话，点一份追加的不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "a26a19286e56494b84e84435aa2c42270a81ba308ac587fc8e11beeb4e464776", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4146c76299212f3d615fffac0d90b7fea24c4d45c9a0b37388f1f7a918ccc6e3", "ja": "遠慮はナシって言っただろ？\nじゃんじゃん頼んでいいぞ！", "zh": "我不是说不用客气了吗？\n尽管开口吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "36ae40f6f63e91a92968c98a815241e460bcbb2177c4eea0e7533c3571dde981", "ja": "やった！", "zh": "太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ec83f683cd7dac5195f39f00b94c449f718014862d394b198ed2f2daab42915f", "ja": "（レコーディングや撮影では、意外な大人っぽさに\n驚いたけど……みんな、まだまだ子どもだな）", "zh": "（录音和拍摄时，我还被她们意外成熟的一面吓了一跳，不过……大家果然还是孩子啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "481c1fda5de7afa3e2cf176375cf59be216203441dba64620e490c7d673e1388", "ja": "じゃあ、次は何を頼もうかな……。\n{$P$}さんもたくさん食べてね！", "zh": "那么，接下来点些什么好呢……  \n{$P$}先生也要多吃点哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_07_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "3346f4099094343761b2882b8e4fedb0992a8efe03768ef95a477dd0016c7448", "ja": "あっ、これよく見たらシークレットレアが\nあるぞ！　チュパカブラだって！", "zh": "啊，这个仔细一看，里面有秘密稀有卡！\n据说是卓柏卡布拉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
